pictl
=
-- rpi-media-centre cli --
Usage:
pictl [SUBCOMMAND]
account|provision a service account
backup [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the backup service
compile [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the compiler service
disk [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the local disks
help|displays this message
install|run the installer
manifest [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the service manifest files
service [SUBCOMMAND]|manage the provided services
=
account||_security_account_provision_service_account
backup||_backup_cli
compile||_compile_cli
disk||_disk_cli
debug||_configuration_pictl_debug
install||_installer_cli
manifest||_manifest_cli
service||_service_cli
=

